<title>GERMANY: Kuehne &amp; Nagel appoints new German sea freight man.</title>
<headline>Kuehne &amp; Nagel appoints new German sea freight man.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freight forwarder Kuehne &amp; Nagel (AG &amp; Co) said it has appointed Horst Schacht as German board member with responsibility for sea freight.</p>
<p>Schacht, 38, was formerly manager for Far East Shipping and Northern Germany/Poland with shipping company Hapag-Lloyd AG, a statement said. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax+ 5017</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
